  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0 (breaking changes: see README \"Migrating to 3.0\")\n      - Package renamed from Mafe.RestClient to Mafesoft.RestClient (assembly Mafesoft.RestClient)\n      - Root namespace renamed from RestClient to Mafesoft.RestClient (RestClient.Http becomes Mafesoft.RestClient.Http, etc.)\n      - ActivitySource renamed from \"Mafe.RestClient\" to \"Mafesoft.RestClient\"\n      - RefreshToken(Func<CancellationToken, Task<RestResult>>) replaces RefreshToken(bool) + RefreshTokenInvoke(...)\n      - RestProperties is read-only, Rest.Build(RestProperties/Action<RestProperties>) removed, new CertificateOption(...)\n\n      Full changelog: https://github.com/fmazzant/RestClient/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
